(6359319, 941299, 117474, '<td valign="top">Hmm. <br/>To me this image isn''t about the sunset, as per the title. It''s about the mountains and the skiers. There isn''t enough sky for it to be about the sunset.  <br/>Nice image, all the same. I figure most people won''t care about what I mentioned above. It does make me wish I was skiing!<br/> <br/>Coming back to this cause I didn''t explain it well and one might justifiably take issue with it... <br/>You do say sunset colours (suggesting the shot isn''t about the sunset at all). The mountains don''t seem to be in sunset colours to me. Just the clouds. Was there more of a sky the warmer tones would justify the title to me.<br/>It''s probably just me, though, cause I''m a little particular about titles.</td>', 'Hmm. To me this image isn''t about the sunset, as per the title. It''s about the mountains and the skiers. There isn''t enough sky for it to be about the sunset.  Nice image, all the same. I figure most people won''t care about what I mentioned above. It does make me wish I was skiing! Coming back to this cause I didn''t explain it well and one might justifiably take issue with it... You do say sunset colours (suggesting the shot isn''t about the sunset at all). The mountains don''t seem to be in sunset colours to me. Just the clouds. Was there more of a sky the warmer tones would justify the title to me.It''s probably just me, though, cause I''m a little particular about titles.', '2011-03-21 20:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
