(6359361, 941146, 121949, '<td valign="top">Such a fitting title for this challenge. You have captured this bird beautifully. The detail in the wings is amazing and I am noticing you even have a catch light in the eye. Even the twigs in the corner play an important part of making this image great, the colors contrast nicely with the blue of the bird. One of the top images in this challenge for sure.</td>', 'Such a fitting title for this challenge. You have captured this bird beautifully. The detail in the wings is amazing and I am noticing you even have a catch light in the eye. Even the twigs in the corner play an important part of making this image great, the colors contrast nicely with the blue of the bird. One of the top images in this challenge for sure.', '2011-03-21 20:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6359369, 941299, 54446, '<td valign="top">Actually, pretty amazing image.  On my monitor, the image appears to have a magenta cast on the lower half.  The sky and distant mountains are neutral to slightly warm.  It''s a tough angle to the sun you have chosen.  The detail is great.  I think this could be reprocessed to much better advantage.</td>', 'Actually, pretty amazing image.  On my monitor, the image appears to have a magenta cast on the lower half.  The sky and distant mountains are neutral to slightly warm.  It''s a tough angle to the sun you have chosen.  The detail is great.  I think this could be reprocessed to much better advantage.', '2011-03-21 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
