(6367575, 941823, 67152, '<td valign="top">Very nice work on controlling the lighting here. I wonder if a bit more sharpness on the glasses and liquid could have been achieved had you used a smaller aperture.  This would have provided you a bit more depth of field as well.</td>', 'Very nice work on controlling the lighting here. I wonder if a bit more sharpness on the glasses and liquid could have been achieved had you used a smaller aperture.  This would have provided you a bit more depth of field as well.', '2011-03-30 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6367664, 941823, 129091, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bassbone:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice work on controlling the lighting here. I wonder if a bit more sharpness on the glasses and liquid could have been achieved had you used a smaller aperture.  This would have provided you a bit more depth of field as well. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks great feedback!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-30 12:02:16.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by bassbone: Very nice work on controlling the lighting here. I wonder if a bit more sharpness on the glasses and liquid could have been achieved had you used a smaller aperture.  This would have provided you a bit more depth of field as well.   Thanks great feedback!', '2011-03-30 13:01:30.000000', '2011-03-30 13:02:16.000000', 0),
