(6452775, 941030, 45631, '<td valign="top">Love this, and what a great idea to actually have it printed and hung on the wall.  It will definitely be a talking piece.</td>', 'Love this, and what a great idea to actually have it printed and hung on the wall.  It will definitely be a talking piece.', '2011-06-26 08:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466996, 941164, 70265, '<td valign="top">Just seeing this for the first time (been away from DPC for awhile). Love love love ... everything about this gorgeous image!!! Straight to favs.</td>', 'Just seeing this for the first time (been away from DPC for awhile). Love love love ... everything about this gorgeous image!!! Straight to favs.', '2011-07-10 15:04:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6593456, 941750, 59029, '<td valign="top">Great shot and setup, congrats on the blue!  Wondering if food colouring might be a good alternative to coloring ink?</td>', 'Great shot and setup, congrats on the blue!  Wondering if food colouring might be a good alternative to coloring ink?', '2011-11-13 09:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6717628, 941146, 29011, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot all around. Congrats on the HM. Didn''t vote in the challenge and just happened to come upon this shot. Would you have any quarrels to cloning out that piece of twig that extends under the bird''s right wing? the shot would''ve been a clean 10 for me. It would''ve felt more free and open as that piece of twig is somewhat distracting. It''s a personal issue I understand as I''ve been hesitant to clone out things which I would''ve loved to have not in the shot but left them in. Was sort of in a 50/50 situation.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-03-20 17:19:13.</i></td>', 'A wonderful shot all around. Congrats on the HM. Didn''t vote in the challenge and just happened to come upon this shot. Would you have any quarrels to cloning out that piece of twig that extends under the bird''s right wing? the shot would''ve been a clean 10 for me. It would''ve felt more free and open as that piece of twig is somewhat distracting. It''s a personal issue I understand as I''ve been hesitant to clone out things which I would''ve loved to have not in the shot but left them in. Was sort of in a 50/50 situation.', '2012-03-20 17:18:38.000000', '2012-03-20 17:19:13.000000', 0),
(6747896, 941146, 97225, '<td valign="top">This shot is so lovely, I can''t believe anyone could give it a 3 without malicious intent. Congratulations on getting it published. (This comment is seriously belated, but I did give you a 9.)</td>', 'This shot is so lovely, I can''t believe anyone could give it a 3 without malicious intent. Congratulations on getting it published. (This comment is seriously belated, but I did give you a 9.)', '2012-04-21 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6933870, 941604, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are so clever with this stuff. I;m going to have to investigate this jello business...</td>', 'You are so clever with this stuff. I;m going to have to investigate this jello business...', '2012-12-16 00:09:49.000000', NULL, 0),
